                    <div class="v6-ingredient-card"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0619/6861/3445/files/CL-13IngredientImages-v1_11_2.png?v=1767987424" alt="Zeaxanthin" class="w-12 h-12 mx-auto mb-3 object-cover" loading="lazy"><p>Zeaxanthin</p><p>2 mg -- macular protection</p></div>
