                    </button>
                    <div class="accordion-content" :class="{ 'open': openFaq === 3 }">
                        <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-warm-gray">{{ section.settings.faq_3_answer | default: '<p>No. Coastline is not a greens powder. It is a precision longevity system with 13 ingredients selected for their clinical evidence in addressing the hallmarks of aging. Every ingredient is dosed to match published clinical trials.</p>' }}</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="border border-light-gray bg-white">
                    <button class="w-full flex justify-between items-center p-6 text-left" @click="openFaq = openFaq === 4 ? null : 4">
                        <span class="font-grotesk text-deep-ink pr-8">{{ section.settings.faq_4_question | default: 'I just cancelled Blueprint. Can I start Coastline right away?' }}</span>
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-warm-gray transition-transform" :class="{ 'rotate-180': openFaq === 4 }" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                    </button>
                    <div class="accordion-content" :class="{ 'open': openFaq === 4 }">
                        <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-warm-gray">{{ section.settings.faq_4_answer | default: '<p>Yes. There is no waiting period. Order today and your Coastline system ships right away. Most customers notice a difference within the first few weeks.</p>' }}</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="border border-light-gray bg-white">
                    <button class="w-full flex justify-between items-center p-6 text-left" @click="openFaq = openFaq === 5 ? null : 5">
                        <span class="font-grotesk text-deep-ink pr-8">{{ section.settings.faq_5_question | default: 'How do I take Coastline?' }}</span>
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-warm-gray transition-transform" :class="{ 'rotate-180': openFaq === 5 }" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                    </button>
                    <div class="accordion-content" :class="{ 'open': openFaq === 5 }">
                        <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-warm-gray">{{ section.settings.faq_5_answer | default: '<p class="mb-4"><strong class="text-deep-ink">Morning Step:</strong> Mix the powder blend with water or your favorite beverage and take with your first meal.</p><p class="mb-4"><strong class="text-deep-ink">Softgels:</strong> Take with your first meal, alongside the Morning Blend.</p><p><strong class="text-deep-ink">Evening Step:</strong> Take the capsules before bed to support sleep and recovery.</p>' }}</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                
                
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    </div>

